&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has 11+ years of sales, strategy and operations experience in a high-tech growth environment, or operational experience in investment banking or management consulting or private equity or venture capital, or business insights / analytics roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has strong analytical skills and a structured approach to solving unique business problems. Has experience working with data and large data sets to identify trends and create insights to make recommendations to senior leaders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has an enthusiastic “roll up your sleeves” mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works well with a high degree of adaptability and flexibility in a fast paced, often ambiguous, and rapidly changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
