&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated acumen in guiding technical strategy, architecture, and roadmap planning for complex infrastructure systems in ambiguous, fast-changing environments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and communication skills, with the ability to leverage data to drive decision-making and influence cross-functional teams across all levels of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
