&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Proficiency in SQL for data analysis and querying, with the ability to interpret datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Experience working with API’s.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Exceptional problem-solving skills, capable of diagnosing complex issues and driving them to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Proven experience in stakeholder management, with the ability to influence cross-functional teams and drive progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Experience in project management, particularly in optimizing processes, workflows, or support operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
