&lt;li&gt;An ability to seamlessly transition from the high level to very detailed, and a willingness to “roll up your sleeves”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A detail-oriented and analytical individual with business acumen, and the ability to influence and communicate within all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
