&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage user facing products and platforms to lower Stripe’s financial and regulatory risk while retaining a best in class user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business problems into scalable engineering solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders from engineering, product, policy, legal, operations, and data science teams&lt;/li&gt;
