&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive medium to large-sized technical projects in collaboration with external partners and cross-functional internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with experience leveraging data to enhance decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
