&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Assistant Controller, the Accounting Manager will be responsible for reconciling and analyzing platform data in the company&#39;s financial / platform systems. This position requires impeccable attention to detail and a focus on process improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
