&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for in you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of engineering management experience, ideally leading frontend or full-stack product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency in modern frontend development — React, React Native, TypeScript, testing infrastructure, and web performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shipping high-quality, high-traffic user experiences at scale — you sweat the details on quality and user experience, not just delivery speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing cross-functional dependencies and coordinating across backend, design, and product teams to keep complex initiatives moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills — able to build alignment across teams, represent your team to leadership, and translate product vision into technical execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates the ability to responsibly use generative AI tools and copilots (e.g., LibreChat, Gemini, Glean) in daily workflows, continuously learn as tools evolve, and apply human-in-the-loop practices to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
