&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to be pushed beyond what you think you’re capable of?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Coinbase, our mission is to increase economic freedom in the world. It’s a massive, ambitious opportunity that demands the best of us, every day, as we build the emerging onchain platform — and with it, the future global financial system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we’re seeking a very specific candidate. We want someone who is passionate about our mission and who believes in the power of crypto and blockchain technology to update the financial system. We want someone who is eager to leave their mark on the world, who relishes the pressure and privilege of working with high caliber colleagues, and who actively seeks feedback to keep leveling up. We want someone who will run towards, not away from, solving the company’s hardest problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/mission&quot;&gt;work culture&lt;/a&gt; is intense and isn’t for everyone. But if you want to build the future alongside others who excel in their disciplines and expect the same from you, there’s no better place to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While many roles at Coinbase are remote-first, we are not remote-only. In-person participation is required throughout the year. Team and company-wide offsites are held multiple times annually to foster collaboration, connection, and alignment. Attendance is expected and fully supported.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring an Engineering Manager to lead the Tax Engineering team within the Consumer Product Group. Tax Engineering sits at the intersection of every trade, every payment, and every product Coinbase ships on the hot path. When a user buys Bitcoin, sells an equity, earns staking rewards, or redeems an Advisor-managed strategy, our systems calculate cost basis, track gain/loss, determine withholding obligations, and produce the reporting that keeps Coinbase compliant across every product line and legal entity globally. As EM, you&#39;ll lead a 12-person team (IC4–IC6) building the primitives that make every new product launch possible from 1099 reporting infrastructure to automated withholding and clearing integrations with our partner Apex. Scale and accuracy are both non-negotiable. If you want to work on systems that are technically demanding, financially consequential, and impossible to ignore, this is the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical roadmap for Tax Engineering, driving the architecture and execution for cost basis tracking, gain/loss calculation, withholding automation, and reporting infrastructure that powers Coinbase&#39;s tax compliance at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow a high-performing team of 12 engineers (IC4–IC6), coaching them to deliver impact while supporting their career development and fostering a culture of technical excellence and operational rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the tax primitives for new products as Coinbase expands into equities, margin, options, and beyond — ensuring our architecture is extensible by design and every product launch has the tax infrastructure it needs from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Product, Design, and trading teams (Equities, Futures, Spot Crypto, DEX, Prediction Markets) to translate complex tax and regulatory requirements into scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive delivery of mission-critical systems including 1099-B and 1099-DA broker reporting pipelines, automated withholding deduction, and clearing integrations with Apex — systems where accuracy and reliability are non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape engineering processes and practices that enable fast, high-quality execution in a domain where correctness is paramount, including testing strategies, data validation, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the team by partnering closely with Talent to identify, attract, and hire exceptional engineering talent who thrive at the intersection of complex systems and real-world financial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in software engineering, with deep expertise in building and scaling distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of engineering management experience, including coaching engineers, managing performance, and building high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth equivalent to a Staff Engineer you&#39;ve been hands-on at a high level before moving into management and can still dive deep on architecture, code, and technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building data-intensive systems where accuracy, auditability, and scale are all critical financial systems, compliance infrastructure, or similarly consequential domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of distributed systems architecture, data pipelines, and the trade-offs involved in building reliable infrastructure that processes high-volume, high-stakes transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering cross-functionally with Product, Legal, Compliance, or Finance teams to translate complex requirements into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in fast-paced, ambiguous environments where new products and regulatory requirements continuously expand the problem space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates the ability to responsibly use generative AI tools and copilots (e.g., LibreChat, Gemini, Glean) in daily workflows, continuously learn as tools evolve, and apply human-in-the-loop practices to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with tax systems, cost basis engines, 1099 reporting, or financial compliance infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with equities, options, or margin trading or strong interest in learning trading/brokerage domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background at a tech-focused company (fintech, crypto, high-growth startup) rather than traditional finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
