&lt;li&gt;You have experience building platforms that serve internal operational teams at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have gone through rapid growth in your company (from startup to mid-size).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with Blockchain technology (such as Bitcoin, Ethereum, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
