&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on the Consumer Foundations team, you will partner with engineers across the retail team to reach these goals.&amp;nbsp;This is a unique opportunity to define and drive a company-wide quality strategy while working critical product teams used by millions of users around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain dashboards and tools to identify and drive improvements to key quality metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering teams to tackle key reliability/performance initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for quality culture improvements by improving testing, observability and tech debt management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with PM, Design, and other functions to align product strategy with long-term technical bets and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate engineering quality and promote best practices through design review, code review guidance, and process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the adoption of AI-driven development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we look for in you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software development experience with experience writing performant, large scale distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering background (experience with Python, Java, JavaScript, Go, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability, debugging, and profiling to improve software reliability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for improving product experience and engineering hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate with teams across the company and influence engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving complex platform-level challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving engineering standards across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates the ability to responsibly use generative AI tools and copilots (e.g., LibreChat, Gemini, Glean) in daily workflows, continuously learn as tools evolve, and apply human-in-the-loop practices to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Blockchain technology (such as Bitcoin, Ethereum etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crypto-forward experience, including familiarity with onchain activity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
