&lt;li&gt;Redesign and manage the Preferred Vendor program, establishing clear performance metrics, governance standards, and review cadences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate extended workforce data, including service periods, end dates, and worker classifications, to support compliance, audit readiness, and workforce reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable reporting dashboards and program metrics that provide leaders with actionable insights for workforce planning and cost management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance and Legal to manage extended workforce considerations during mergers and acquisitions, ensuring seamless integration and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and deliver training materials and a centralized knowledge base to guide internal teams and external suppliers on extended workforce processes and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement process improvements and automation opportunities that increase efficiency and strengthen program controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
