&lt;li&gt;Set and communicate clear technical direction aligned with product strategy, holding a high bar for quality, performance, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with design, product, data, machine learning, and safety teams to shape the social experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architectural decisions and foster a culture of high-quality code and strong engineering processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a collaborative, inclusive team environment where engineers across levels can grow, take ownership, and do their best work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support engineers through hiring, onboarding, performance feedback, and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of engineering management experience leading product-focused engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in building consumer-facing products at scale, with experience working through the stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of web architecture and best practices for building modular, scalable systems within large, evolving codebases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating distributed systems that handle high traffic or real-time data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to grow engineers across levels through mentorship, feedback, and clear expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An execution-focused mindset, capable of navigating ambiguity and delivering results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
