&lt;div&gt;We are seeking an Engineering Manager&amp;nbsp;to lead a high-performing engineering team responsible for building and scaling systems that power Robinhood’s global product expansion. You will own a critical product and engineering surface within the International organization, partnering closely with cross-functional leaders to deliver robust, scalable, and localized experiences for customers around the world.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;As part of the &lt;strong&gt;International Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will play a key role in executing Robinhood’s global strategy by building reliable systems and driving high-quality technical execution in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA or New York, NY offices, with in-person attendance expected 5 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead a high-performing team:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage, mentor, and grow a team of engineers, setting a high bar for execution, ownership, and technical quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own team execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive delivery of complex projects end-to-end, ensuring clear prioritization, predictable execution, and high-quality outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner cross-functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with product, design, data, and partner engineering teams to translate business goals into actionable plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to technical direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide system design and architecture decisions to ensure scalability, reliability, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the engineering bar:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish strong engineering practices across code quality, testing, observability, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hire and develop talent:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively recruit and retain top engineers, and support their growth through coaching and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate with ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify gaps, resolve ambiguity, and drive initiatives forward with a strong sense of accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You Bring&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6–9 years of software engineering experience, including 1+ years of experience managing engineers, with a track record of supporting performance and career development&lt;/li&gt;
