&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gcmc7d&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;108&quot;&gt;Build and enhance iOS features using Swift and UIKit and/or SwiftUI to support core customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;604s68&quot; data-start=&quot;109&quot; data-end=&quot;221&quot;&gt;Contribute to mobile architecture and code structure to ensure scalability, reliability, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2r2x06&quot; data-start=&quot;355&quot; data-end=&quot;462&quot;&gt;Optimize app performance and responsiveness using iOS profiling and debugging tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wr8czh&quot; data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;562&quot;&gt;Write clean, maintainable, and well-tested code and standard iOS testing practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 4+ years of professional iOS development experience, including shipping customer-facing features in production applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate solid proficiency in Swift and modern iOS frameworks (e.g., SwiftUI, UIKit), and apply established architectural patterns to build maintainable, testable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You independently own medium-to-large features from technical design through implementation, testing, and release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write clean, well-documented code and contribute to code reviews that improve quality and team standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate effectively with product managers, designers, and backend engineers to translate requirements into reliable, performant mobile experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
