&lt;li&gt;Research volatility catalysts, including earnings, regulatory announcements, geopolitical events, and broader market trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor market risk dashboards to identify significant exposures or shifts in customer behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data to identify risks and opportunities to improve the customer experience related to margin products.&lt;/li&gt;
