&lt;p&gt;The Trading Products team sits at the core of Robinhood’s brokerage business, building products that support millions of customers in making financial decisions. Design on this team moves faster through AI—we explore directions with LLMs early, prototype with AI tooling in parallel, and ship polished systems. This lets us iterate quickly without sacrificing craft. You’ll work closely with product managers, engineers, researchers, and brokerage leadership to create thoughtful, high-quality experiences that are grounded in user needs and measurable outcomes!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer, you will lead design for emerging products for active traders. You will take an AI-first approach to design incredible experiences, shape product direction, and present ideas to leadership. This role requires balancing strategic thinking with hands-on design execution while navigating ambiguity in a regulated environment. You will contribute to product direction, present ideas to leadership, and deliver experiences that help build trust in AI-driven financial tools!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA and New York, NY office(s), with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
