&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end design for trading products from early concepts through launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers, engineers, and researchers to define product direction and user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use large language models to explore product ideas, clarify user needs, and outline initial approaches, helping your team align quickly on direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and iterate on prototypes using AI-assisted tools, shaping flows and interactions while partnering with engineers to bring the strongest concepts into production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex financial and AI-driven concepts into clear, intuitive user interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present design work to cross-functional partners and leadership, incorporating feedback into iterations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure designs meet quality standards, align with regulatory requirements, and support user trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
