&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable experimenting with AI-assisted development tools (such as Claude Code), even if you are not writing production-level code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can take projects from ambiguous problem spaces to clear, executable design solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate design decisions effectively to cross-functional partners and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working in regulated environments or on financial products (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
