&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an exceptional &lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to help shape the future of our crypto experiences. Crypto is one of the most dynamic and rapidly evolving spaces in technology, offering endless opportunities for innovation and creativity. As a designer in this field, you’ll tackle complex challenges—like simplifying decentralized systems, building trust in a new financial paradigm, and making crypto truly accessible to all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is your chance to work with finance and technology, crafting products that empower people to interact with and understand crypto in intuitive, meaningful ways. You’ll be designing solutions that break down barriers, foster financial inclusion, and redefine how people engage with our product, all while collaborating with a forward-thinking team passionate about transforming this space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA, New York, NY, and Bellevue, WA office(s), with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Vision&lt;/strong&gt;: Drive the design strategy and execution for key crypto features and experiences, setting a high bar for design excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Future&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define how people interact with and understand crypto, simplifying complex systems for diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;: Ensure our designs empower users of all backgrounds, building experiences that are accessible, equitable, and user-friendly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own End-to-End Design&lt;/strong&gt;: From research and ideation to prototyping and delivery, you’ll take ownership of crafting seamless, impactful designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor and Inspire&lt;/strong&gt;: Provide guidance and leadership within the design team, fostering collaboration, growth, and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Extensive experience designing for complex, user-focused products at scale, with a strong portfolio that showcases your ability to simplify intricate workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crypto Curiosity&lt;/strong&gt;: While deep crypto knowledge isn’t required, an eagerness to dive in and understand the space is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive Design Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;: A strong commitment to creating equitable and accessible experiences that resonate with diverse user groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Problem Solver&lt;/strong&gt;: You excel at balancing micro and macro perspectives, creating cohesive design systems that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration Skills&lt;/strong&gt;: A proven track record of partnering with engineering, product, and research teams to bring ideas to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best in class benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/li&gt;
