&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive the technical direction&lt;/strong&gt; alongside engineering leads — making high-conviction decisions on AI architecture, model strategy, and system design that keep Cortex at the frontier of what&#39;s possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and evolve evaluation frameworks at scale&lt;/strong&gt; — establish the automated quality, accuracy, and safety measurement systems that let the team ship with confidence and improve continuously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship consumer experiences that drive adoption and retention&lt;/strong&gt; — find the moments where AI creates real value in customers&#39; financial lives and deliver them with craft and speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate the regulatory landscape&lt;/strong&gt; — partner with Legal &amp;amp; Compliance to responsibly expand what Cortex can do, from neutral research toward personalized financial guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead cross-functional execution&lt;/strong&gt; across engineering, design, data science, compliance, and operations — turning ambiguity into shipped product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
