&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$204,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$255,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The BizTech BI&amp;amp;Analytics team partners with business and finance stakeholders to deliver scalable self-serve analytics &amp;amp; AI transformation programs, budgeting &amp;amp; forecasting solutions, reliable data pipelines, and trusted metrics &amp;amp; dashboards.&amp;nbsp; Empowering timely, compliant, data‑driven decisions and a robust analytics foundation across Airbnb.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a high-caliber Staff Systems Engineer to lead our Oracle EPM Planning systems and processes.&amp;nbsp; This is a critical role within the Airbnb BizTech organization supporting Finance.&amp;nbsp; The ideal candidate will be the primary technical architect and developer of the EPM environment with in-depth subject matter expertise in the Finance Budgeting and Forecasting function.&amp;nbsp; Responsibilities include financial forecast modeling, system and AI-driven process transformation, integration with the data warehouse, and the technical mastery to translate complex business requirements into scalable Oracle EPM solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; System Admin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application: Lead the design, configuration, and maintenance of Oracle EPM Planning modules (Financials, Workforce, Capital, Cash Forecast, Long Range Planning, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calculations &amp;amp; Modeling: Develop and enhance complex business rules and calc scripts. Proficiency in Groovy Scripting for advanced data and forecast modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Integration: Architect and monitor data flows with AWS data warehouse, Oracle ERP Cloud, Workday leverage Data Management, EPM Automate and internal Airbnb integration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environment Management: Manage the monthly Oracle patch cycle, including regression testing and impact analysis of new features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;FP&amp;amp;A Functional Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process Improvement: Partner closely with FP&amp;amp;A to continue to streamline the budget and forecasting process by automating manual offline models and enhancing data integration to reduce forecast cycle and improve accuracy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Analytics: Build and maintain critical and complex reports using Financial Reporting Web Studio; Smart View expert assisting finance users with ad-hoc analysis and template creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User Support: Monthly forecast cycle user support to resolve critical issues timely; engage Oracle support when needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; AI Strategy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy Setting: Collaborate closely with Finance &amp;amp; Tech leaders to set strategies to deliver next gen capabilities, drive initiatives and projects with clear business value and impact.&amp;nbsp; Cross functional alignment on resource allocation and prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Transformation: AI/ML proficiency with hand-on experiences on agentic AI and workflows.&amp;nbsp; The ability to identify opportunities and drive FP&amp;amp;A adoption to transform processes into AI-generated forecast, analysis and insights. Experience does not have to be with built in EPM AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;9+ years of hands-on experience in Oracle Hyperion/EPM (minimum 4 years in EPM Cloud). Experience with EPM automate, groovy scripting, building forms, complex reports, application optimization, and administering user access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience supporting finance functions (FP&amp;amp;A, Accounting, Treasury, Tax) with strong financial statement literacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL for data validation, pipeline troubleshooting, and ad-hoc analysis against warehouse tables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience driving integrations between Oracle EPM and ERP via OIC or equivalent middleware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating data orchestration and ETL/ELT pipelines: monitoring workflow health, managing and re-running failed tasks, reviewing execution logs, and coordinating pipeline incidents with owning teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; able to confidently lead and drive cross functional stakeholder meetings.&amp;nbsp; Clearly communicate and document technical processes for non-tech stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional skills in translating business requirements into scalable solutions within or outside of EPM Planning.&amp;nbsp; Provide options and recommendations for decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/a&gt; for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list. If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
