&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the evolution of sourcing workflows by helping implement AI-enabled analysis, deal summaries, and supplier evaluation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with internal stakeholders and external partners to drive successful negotiations and supplier outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in procurement, sourcing, consulting, or technology vendor management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience sourcing technology categories such as cloud infrastructure, developer platforms, AI technologies, or engineering services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation and commercial strategy experience in complex technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate technical requirements into commercial strategies and supplier decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with engineering or product organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and structured problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using data, automation, or AI tools to improve business workflows or decision processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$128,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The Roadmap Planning &amp;amp; Program Management team sits at the intersection of strategy and execution with the aim of planning and delivering the company’s priority products while providing executives the visibility and input they require to guide major releases.&amp;nbsp; You would be joining the business process and operations (BPO) sub-team which is responsible for streamlining processes, supporting strategic initiatives and ensuring that operations are carried out efficiently across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Workshop Operations Manager, a senior individual contributor role, focused on the planning, scheduling and coordinating the key discovery and decision making forums in support of the Executive CEO Workshop schedule.&amp;nbsp; This advanced operational role is responsible for designing and sustaining the processes, tools, and automations for what is our Workshop Operating System - the operational backbone that connects the company&#39;s product roadmap teams to its most senior leaders.&amp;nbsp; The Workshop Operating System is what enables leaders to review the right work at the right time.&amp;nbsp; Critical skills and abilities for success in this role include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive partnership with key stakeholders like C-suite EAs, Program Managers and functional stakeholders to ensure the Workshop Operating System is connected to leaders who are responsible for how the business is growing and scaling to achieve company goals.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flawless execution of daily tasks and maintaining standard workflows, including complex scheduling and prioritization management across various stakeholders and functions, data gathering on existing workflows or timeline management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence without direct authority, negotiating priorities for time allocation across cross-functional teams, and building the trust and credibility needed to drive alignment when stakeholders have competing needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated systems thinking, attention to detail, the ability to zoom out and see cross-functional dependencies, and the judgment to make real-time prioritization trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying bottlenecks or areas of process and/or communication improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balancing the demands of leaders and cross-functional working teams under tight timelines and rapidly changing circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and continuously improve the Workshop Operating System (WOS) infrastructure that powers the workshop process - going beyond maintaining tools to architecting them for scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule and prioritize weekly meetings for leaders to support the execution of the company roadmap, ensuring all meeting requests are complete and accurate.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and collaborate closely with C-suite and VP-level executive assistants and business partners to prioritize meetings and navigate scheduling conflicts, negotiate competing priorities, following up with requestors, managing daily change requests across multiple channels, bringing clarity out of complexity and communicating clearly and in a timely manner to all stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect and triage executive feedback in partnership with program leadership, driving issues to resolution and escalating for guidance when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with other roadmap planning and business process and operations colleagues to ensure the entire operations system is optimized for supporting leaderships’ needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate with the highest standards of integrity, credibility, and trustworthiness; maintain confidentiality of highly sensitive information and data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in operations, program coordination, or business process management in a fast-paced, dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role is located in the SF Bay Area with frequent work happening in office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design, build, and scale operational systems - not just use existing tools, but design the infrastructure that others rely on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating directly with executive C-suite and VP-level executive assistants, exercising strong judgment for prioritization and navigating ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills that can simplify complex operational landscapes at a variety of altitudes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in operational tooling such as Airtable, GSuite, or similar platforms, including experience with automation and scripting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence without direct management authority: build trust, negotiate trade-offs, and drive alignment across cross-functional stakeholders with competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in tech or consulting sectors preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-year degree in business or a related field preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimal travel required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of this position, the successful applicant will need to be based in San Francisco-Bay Area, CA to be able to conduct their work. Currently, employees can not be located in: Alaska, Indiana, Nebraska, North Dakota, Ohio, South Dakota, Wisconsin, Alabama, Mississippi, Oklahoma, Delaware And Rhode Island. This list is continuously being updated, please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list. &amp;nbsp;If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$132,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$155,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;SLSQ227R51&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we’re on a mission to help organisations use data and AI to solve the world’s toughest problems — and few opportunities are more rewarding than driving positive change across Australia&#39;s Federal sector. We’re looking for a passionate and results-driven Enterprise Account Executive to help our government partners harness the full power of the Databricks platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a pioneering sales role within our Public Sector Sales team, reporting directly to the Senior Sales Director. You’ll work at the forefront of digital transformation in the Federal Sector, helping agencies reimagine how they deliver outcomes and play a pivotal role in shaping Databricks’ presence across the country. As a successful candidate, you are a creative, energetic self-starter who understands the sales process. You know how to sell innovation and change through customer vision expansion and can drive deals forward to compress decision cycles. You love understanding a product in depth and are passionate about communicating its value to Customers and System Integrators. Always hunting for new opportunities, you will be asked to close net new accounts while maintaining existing accounts. Along with the chance to close an exciting deal, we also offer accelerators above 100% quota accomplishment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving Consumption: Help customers derive value from the platform by identifying key use cases and increasing usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion real-world change: Lead initiatives that make measurable impact — from accelerating innovation in health and education to supporting sustainability and economic development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape Databricks’ Public Sector footprint: Identify, structure, and close strategic opportunities that align our capabilities with Australia’s digital priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspire through connection: Build trusted relationships with senior decision-makers, tell compelling stories about our impact, and influence at the highest levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute with excellence: Manage the end-to-end sales cycle — from prospecting and initial engagement to closing transformative deals and driving platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate for success: Work with solution architects, customer success, and global teams to deliver solutions that empower customers and ensure long-term success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What We Look For:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for impact — you’re motivated by helping organisations use technology for the public good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in Federal or Public Sector sales, ideally in Cloud, Data, or SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic and structured in approach, with strong execution and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth mindset, creativity, and adaptability in dynamic, innovative environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Spark and Big Data is highly desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security clearance (NV1) preferred. If not, eligible to apply for NV1 clearance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1648&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the data and AI company. More than 10,000 organizations worldwide — including Comcast, Condé Nast, Grammarly, and over 50% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform to unify and democratize data, analytics and AI. Databricks is headquartered in San Francisco, with offices around the globe and was founded by the original creators of Lakehouse, Apache Spark™, Delta Lake and MLflow. To learn more, follow Databricks on&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot; href=&quot;https://twitter.com/databricks&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://twitter.com/databricks&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1700237575733000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw03FL8fJvOD97ytN02f5G2C&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1700237575733000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw15dLk3q8VxTfHEgCUg7NSt&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/databricksinc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.facebook.com/databricksinc&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1700237575733000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw39EcncitnlqV72EG2-RqXJ&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SLSQ227R75&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks is looking for a Senior Geo Hunter Executive to join us in Melbourne, Australia. This role is designed as a Hunter role with a focus on Energy and Utilities. As a Hunter at Databricks, you are pivotal in driving the company&#39;s growth by acquiring new customers and expanding into new territories. You will focus on converting prospects into customers and driving the initial consumption of Databricks&#39; services. You will report to the Director, Enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activating New Databricks Customers: Get customers to their first dollar, or Databricks Unit as we like to call it, and accelerate Pay-as-you-go customers past their initial use-cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving Consumption: Help customers derive value from the platform by identifying key use cases and increasing usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Securing Strategic Committed Deals: Identify, structure and close opportunities to co-invest in high-priority initiatives to accelerate and de-risk project delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospecting and Lead Generation: Use a range of strategies and resources, including intent signals, territory planning, and customer stories, to effectively identify and target leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect Engagement: Leverage BDRs, Marketing and Network to build relationships with key prospects in the territory to displace incumbent technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Execution: Conduct first meetings with compelling POVs to create urgency for change. Create territory and account plans to prioritise pursuits. Engage in activities such as roundtables, bootcamps and industry events to build relationships and progress pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline Management: Maintain an accurate and updated Salesforce (SF) pipeline, create proof of concepts (POCs), and manage the sales cycle from initial contact to closing the deal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: Engage with architects, professional services engagement managers coordinate demand planning sessions, and align with executive sponsors to ensure a comprehensive approach to customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Characteristics:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes initiative, is proactive and drives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resiliency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unwavering Prioritisation and Grit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coachability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to Change and uncertainty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: Proven track record in sales, particularly in acquiring new customers and expanding into new territories. Demonstrable experience in selling innovation, ideally in Big Data, Cloud, or SaaS technology in a consumption-first world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry Experience: This role has a focus on Energy and Utilities, which will be preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills: Strong prospecting, lead generation, and customer engagement skills. Ability to drive consumption and secure first-time commits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: Ability to work effectively with cross-functional teams, including GDRs and Customer Success teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Acumen: Understanding of Databricks&#39; platform and the ability to communicate its value to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
