&lt;div&gt;As a&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Commercial Account Executive at Databricks, you get to work with some of the most exciting, disruptive companies using data to change the world. You are creative and self-motivated with experience running both transactional and strategic sales processes. You know how to sell innovation and change through customer vision expansion and can guide deals forward to compress decision cycles. You love understanding a product in-depth and are passionate about communicating its value to customers and partners. Always prospecting for new opportunities, you will close new accounts while expanding existing accounts. Along with the chance to close exciting deals, we also offer accelerators above 100% quota accomplishment. You will report to a regional sales manager.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a territory plan by 30 days with a clear account prioritization strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align both new and existing customers with the Lakehouse vision and ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to range from faster transactions to large strategic 7 figure deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed activity, pipeline, and revenue targets; you will be expected to prospect and generate pipeline in this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear Salesforce and Clari hygiene including use case, MEDDPICC, revenue forecasts, and account notes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead with a customer first mindset and focus on business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of closing experience, carrying a direct revenue quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in big data, Cloud, or SaaS sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to quickly learn new technologies and value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience exceeding sales KPIs and quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success closing new accounts while working existing accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in MEDDPICC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven history of exceeding annual revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent top performer with a history of internal promotion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
