&lt;p&gt;The Director, Demand Generation (Executive Campaigns) will lead how we go to market with our executive integrated campaigns across key audiences — CIO, CTO, CDO, CISO, and CMO. You’ll drive visibility, engagement, and pipeline creation with top decision-makers while scaling a high-performing global campaign engine. This is a pivotal leadership role responsible for strategy, orchestration, and measurable impact worldwide, setting the foundation for our next stage of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with teams across Corporate Brand, Events, Product and Solutions Marketing, Industry Marketing, Field Marketing Analytics, and Marketing Operations to deliver cohesive, data-driven, and scalable executive programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead alignment and operational rhythm with cross-functional leaders to craft an integrated, data-driven executive marketing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop consistent global programs with aligned goals, messaging, and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect demand generation initiatives to broader brand-building efforts and category-creation strategies that resonate with C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clear executive summaries, data insights, and recommendations that guide decision-making across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct, mentor, and inspire a team of high-performing campaign managers focused on global integrated campaign execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define team structure and talent needs, drive recruiting and onboarding, and maintain a consistently high standard of talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of continuous learning and accountability by setting clear expectations, providing coaching, and offering professional development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Growth &amp;amp; Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver global executive engagement and pipeline targets, partnering across functions to optimize ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure campaign strategies and investments translate into measurable pipeline contribution and long-term customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a global strategic roadmap to test, optimize, and scale future programming informed by data, insights, and performance learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the filter and guide for business priorities, ensuring the team focuses on high-impact activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage prior experience and innovation to continuously evolve our approach, tools, and executional excellence at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;10+ years of managing global integrated campaigns with direct pipeline accountability and a proven track record of exceeding targets. With experience in marketing to executive audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional alignment and stakeholder management: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven ability to work with various cross-functional stakeholders to develop integrated programs that drive joint outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years building, inspiring, and leading high-performing teams with global pipeline and efficiency accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency in pipeline attribution, conversion analysis, and ROI optimization using SFDC, Tableau (or other dashboard systems), and marketing automation platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hyper-Growth Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years scaling integrated campaigns in fast-growing tech companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Process:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience implementing scalable marketing operations, lead management systems, and cross-functional workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
