&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1800&quot;&gt;Databricks is seeking a Director, Financial Systems (Anaplan) to lead and evolve our FP&amp;amp;A Anaplan function. Reporting to the Vice President of Corporate FP&amp;amp;A, this role will be responsible for enabling the broader FP&amp;amp;A organization through strategic ownership and optimization of the Anaplan platform. You will lead a team of three experienced Anaplan professionals, define and execute a forward-looking systems strategy, and partner closely with the Finance Data &amp;amp; Strategy team to unlock the full potential of Anaplan in conjunction with the Databricks platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The impact you will have: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide end to end ownership of the Anaplan platform, ensuring reliability, scalability, and alignment with business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across FP&amp;amp;A to define system roadmaps and lead the successful delivery of key initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Sales Operations Anaplan team to ensure alignment and consistency across FP&amp;amp;A and Sales Operations models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement opportunities to standardize processes, improve efficiency, and increase automation within Anaplan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Finance Data &amp;amp; Strategy team to develop and execute a strategy for integrating Anaplan with the Databricks platform, enabling next generation analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance stakeholders and system integrators to ensure business continuity and system stability during ERP implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross functional teams, including IT and Security, to ensure compliance with internal controls, security standards, and access governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a high performing team of Anaplan professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2367&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree required in Finance, Computer Science, Engineering or Management Information Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Finance / Financial Systems roles, preferably Anaplan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anaplan Certified Solutions Architect or Certified Master Anaplanner, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining systems strategy; developing business and technical requirements; designing and prototyping; testing; training; deployment; and support procedures for Anaplan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Functional experience with core finance processes (planning, budgeting, forecasting, costing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience assessing and supporting finance system implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership skills, including experience coaching and developing high performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity and the ability to solve problems independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to prioritize and manage multiple objectives in a fast-paced environment while meeting deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
