&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;RDQ427R158&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Industry Partner Lead for Healthcare and Life Sciences (HLS)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be responsible for recruiting, developing, and scaling a global partner ecosystem that makes Databricks the premier platform for data-and-AI-intensive HLS workloads. You will own the strategy and execution for top ISVs across the healthcare and life sciences ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a leader who has &quot;seen the movie&quot; within HLS, ideally having spent time at a major cloud hyperscaler or a leading HLS-specific software vendor. This role requires a rare blend of deep domain expertise and GTM acumen. You will sit at the intersection of Product, Engineering, and the Field, ensuring that when a Life Sciences company or Health System chooses Databricks, they have a seamless, integrated ecosystem of partners to accelerate their time-to-value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Prioritization:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and execute the HLS ISV partnership strategy, segmenting the market across BioPharma, Provider, Payer, and Medical Devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Own executive relationships with key HLS partners to drive technical integrations and joint field execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product and Regulatory/Compliance teams to ensure partner integrations meet the rigorous security and &quot;fit-for-purpose&quot; standards required for clinical and genomic data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Proposition:&lt;/strong&gt; Build joint GTM motions that resonate with HLS business personas&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Sales leadership to design co-sell plays and incentives that help our account teams solve complex industry use cases through partner solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Representation:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a thought leader at industry forums to establish Databricks as the backbone of the modern HLS data stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years in product partnerships or business development, with at least 7 years deeply embedded in the &lt;strong&gt;Healthcare and Life Sciences&lt;/strong&gt; technology ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Success launching ISV integrations and GTM motions that have delivered measurable partner-sourced revenue in the HLS space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the HLS data landscape&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to influence internal Product and Engineering teams to prioritize HLS-specific features (e.g., data privacy/de-identification) that unblock partner integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication skills with the ability to build &quot;C-suite ready&quot; narratives for leaders at global pharmaceutical companies and massive health networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; A solid understanding of cloud data architectures and AI/ML lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
