&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Manager, GTM Compensation Design &amp;amp; Execution, will lead the strategy and execution of the seller compensation experience, spanning enablement, tooling, analytics, and process design. This role ensures sellers have clear, real-time visibility into how they earn and perform through intuitive compensation systems, dashboards, and communications. By combining strong operational leadership with emerging AI capabilities, this role will drive automation, transparency, and scalable compensation infrastructure while partnering cross-functionally to align programs with business objectives.&amp;nbsp; This role will fall within Databricks’ GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Operations organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the end-to-end employee experience for sales compensation&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring compensation plans, tools, and processes are transparent, easy to understand, and trusted by the sales organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the compensation enablement program&lt;/strong&gt;, including onboarding, training, documentation, and ongoing communications that help sellers clearly understand how they earn, track progress against quota, and maximize performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and manage sales compensation tools &lt;/strong&gt;that drive workflow automation, performance reporting, and rep-facing earnings visibility. Partner with technical teams to build and deliver new attainment dashboards that provide real-time performance insights for sellers and leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive AI strategy within the sales compensation function&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying opportunities for AI to improve compensation performance insights and enhance rep self-service. Establish a roadmap for AI use cases for the GTM Compensation Program and a path to execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner cross-functionally with GTM Leadership,&amp;nbsp; Finance, Product and IT &lt;/strong&gt;to ensure compensation programs and tools are scalable, compliant, aligned to company goals, and deliver a positive and motivating experience for employees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
