&lt;li&gt;Strong project and time management, managing multiple priorities within deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, skilled in leading meetings and discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Google Suite, MS Excel, Mac, and technology literate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional customer service for internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, detail-oriented, proactive, and capable of managing multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
