&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;637&quot;&gt;Guide strategic customers as they implement transformational big data projects, 3rd party migrations, including end-to-end design, build and deployment of industry-leading big data and AI applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;637&quot;&gt;Consult on architecture and design; bootstrap or implement customer projects which leads to a customers&#39; successful understanding, evaluation and adoption of Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;637&quot;&gt;Provide an escalated level of support for customer operational issues&lt;/li&gt;
