&lt;li&gt;Established relationships with the major telcos/service providers in Australia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading teams serving government or public sector clients within Cloud, SaaS, or Data Analytics industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of Australia’s telco ecosystem, procurement frameworks, and their wholesaler structure. Knowledge of machine learning and IOT is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in building new markets, managing complex sales cycles, and delivering business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing value-based selling frameworks (e.g., MEDDPICC, Challenger, Command of the Message).&lt;/li&gt;
