&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with enterprise IT automation platforms&amp;nbsp; (Tines preferred), or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and troubleshooting integrations between identity, endpoint, ticketing, and security platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and delivering automation for IT processes: onboarding/offboarding, access provisioning, license management, and security compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
