&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional experience in the data space with a technical product (i.e. data warehousing, big data, or machine learning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional experience in the field, architecting and delivering data-driven solutions for major accounts within the Retail, Consumer Products, Travel &amp;amp; Hospitality vertical.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with the buy-side and supply-side ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
