&lt;p&gt;The Enterprise Applications team at Databricks is on an ambitious journey to transform how we run the business.&amp;nbsp; Our mission is to build resilient, in-house platforms and AI-powered capabilities that provide a genuine competitive advantage, powering our next doubling in size and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Software Engineer on the Enterprise Applications team, you will play a critical role delivering end-to-end applications that power our business and empower our employees with truly assistive technologies. You will be responsible for defining the technical roadmap, designing critical software systems, raising the bar on engineering excellence, mentoring junior engineers, and tackling the most challenging technical issues facing the team. You will be the technical leader for a team of software engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you’ll have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
