&lt;li&gt;Enable mechanisms that can drive product-led growth, through seamless onboarding and sharing capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interactive environment for&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;collaborative data projects at massive scale with an easy path to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
