&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building a new federal business line (FedRAMP, IL4/5, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of scaling revenue from early traction to repeatable growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with federal procurement pathways (Prime/sub models, GWACs, IDIQs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationships across agencies and federal systems integrators&lt;/li&gt;
