&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a detail-oriented, cross-functional consultant who can help Asana lead deployments of Asana to our enterprise customers. You will be part of our Professional Services team, and committed to helping customers adopt Asana as both a technology product and a holistic approach to collaboration across their organization. You will be part of a team that strives to help customers across countries, industries, and functions get off on the right foot and continue to get the most value out of the tool over time.&lt;/p&gt;
