&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced Product and Design Talent Acquisition Partner to own recruiting initiatives across our teams. You will partner closely with hiring partners and your Talent Acquisition peers across global offices on all aspects of the hiring strategy, owning full-cycle recruiting efforts and ensuring every hire is as exceptional as the last. We take pride in the craft of building this amazing team and that&#39;s where you come in!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
