&lt;li&gt;Advise hiring teams on strategies that address talent gaps and future talent needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build high trust relationships with hiring partners and become an expert on the strategy, objectives, and needs of the teams you work with&lt;/li&gt;
