&lt;li&gt;Belief that recruiting is a partnership and that you serve as an extension of and partner to your hiring teams; not an &quot;order-taker&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity; can create order out of uncertainty&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates curiosity about AI tools and emerging technologies, with a willingness to learn and leverage them to enhance productivity, collaboration, or decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
