&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1otwuor&quot; data-start=&quot;103&quot; data-end=&quot;230&quot;&gt;Background in public accounting (e.g., Big 4) combined with in-house experience at a high-growth SaaS or technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dgt819&quot; data-start=&quot;231&quot; data-end=&quot;308&quot;&gt;Familiarity with consumption-based or usage-based revenue models at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18iyhmx&quot; data-start=&quot;309&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in fast-paced environments with evolving products and business models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12ptk3o&quot; data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;475&quot;&gt;Experience leading managers and developing technical accounting talent&lt;/li&gt;
