&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will bring strong analytical and technical skills, business intuition, and a collaborative mindset to guide decision-making and unlock growth opportunities. You’ll work on problems ranging from workforce planning and recruiting analytics, employee listening and research, and understanding organizational health and collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
