&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in product marketing or related roles with experience launching net-new products or 0 → 1 initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to quickly learn and market highly technical products and strong communication skills, with the ability to translate technical details into clear and relevant messaging for diverse audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading cross-functional go-to-market initiatives from strategy through execution and measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with Product teams and driving alignment with executive partners&lt;/li&gt;
