&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking to grow our Procurement team and are hiring a Strategic Sourcing Manager to support our growing purchasing needs. This role will be responsible for supporting several departments and will be at the nexus of all supplier engagement activities - including stakeholder relationship management, purchasing planning and negotiations/contracting. We are looking for a category expert who can cover the spend (focused on technology) incurred across all departments including Engineering, IT, Sales &amp;amp; Marketing as well as G&amp;amp;A functions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will report to the Director of Procurement and would be a great fit for someone that thrives in a dynamic, fast-growing, and high energy environment, and are looking for opportunities to learn and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full time role that can be held from one of our US hubs or remotely in the United States.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll do at Figma:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all purchasing needs for assigned departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with department managers and Strategic Finance to anticipate, plan and forecast purchasing needs for assigned departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with department managers to develop accurate scopes of work, including service specifications and any negotiated terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead all supplier engagement processes including conducting vendor due diligence, competitive bids and negotiations. Partner closely with IT for any technology-related purchases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop award scenarios including cost models to support negotiations, decision-making and cost forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee all purchasing activities such as shepherding the purchase request process, working with Legal through the NDA/contracting process and working with Security/Compliance to ensure security/privacy needs are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the deal pipeline including negotiating deal closure timeline with suppliers and actively prioritizing deals with Legal/Security/Compliance Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the execution of spend management projects that accomplish key objectives. Those objectives may include savings, process improvement, supplier consolidation, risk management, sustainable procurement or improving spend visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of relevant experience in technology-focused procurement or supplier management ideally in a fast-paced, high growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in procurement, contracting and negotiating with executives from suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract drafting, negotiations and redlining experience with a passion for driving cost savings and process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer service aptitude and collaboration-focused mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/div&gt;
