&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;At least 8+ years of experience in benefits administration or benefits analysis, ideally within a technology or SaaS organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Experience supporting international benefits programs and collaborating with globally distributed teams across multiple time zones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Understanding of benefits compliance requirements and best practices across multiple regions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and structured problem-solving skills, with the ability to synthesize information and develop thoughtful recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to work effectively across all levels of an organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to treat employee experience as a product, applying product management and design thinking to understand needs, prototype solutions, and drive execution through strong project management and data-driven iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leveraging AI tools in the flow of work. Candidates with a pre-existing comfort level &amp;amp; familiarity using AI to enhance productivity are strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Ability and willingness to travel quarterly for in-personal gatherings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Experience managing or supporting global benefits programs across EMEA, APJ, and NAMER.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Experience working in a distributed or global technology company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency with Excel and HR systems such as Workday.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Familiarity with design thinking or product-style approaches to improving employee experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Experience using AI tools such as ChatGPT or similar technologies to enhance productivity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;US Zone 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;This role is not available in Zone 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 2&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$136,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$184,200 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 3&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$121,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$163,800 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Commercial Counsel&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt; - EMEA Lead&lt;/span&gt; to be a key member of Dropbox’s global commercial legal team with a primary focus on &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;EMEA sales and channel&lt;/span&gt; related deals, processes, and relationships&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;, as well as EMEA-specific procurement deal work and support&lt;/span&gt;. Reporting directly to the Head of Global Commercial Legal, this leadership role offers an exciting opportunity to have company-wide impact primarily supporting Dropbox’s &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;EMEA and global&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;sales and channel &lt;/span&gt;strategy and other cross functional teams &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;and EMEA-specific procurement deal work and support&lt;/span&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for an experienced in-house attorney in the commercial legal space with a client-first mindset and experience working closely with &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;sales and channel&lt;/span&gt; teams to innovate and leverage technology to create and drive efficiencies in a world class commercial legal function in support of Dropbox’s business goals. You’ll be part of a team of attorneys and professionals responsible for drafting, reviewing, and negotiating a high volume of complex commercial contracts with Dropbox business &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;customer, channel &lt;/span&gt;partners&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt; and distributors, and vendors&lt;/span&gt; around the world. Willing to act as both a team player and a mentor, you&#39;ll be primarily responsible for partnering with our &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;sales and channel&lt;/span&gt;, finance, product, and other business teams to deliver efficient, scalable approaches to commercial matters, with a focus on &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;sales and channel&lt;/span&gt; deals, processes, and relationships.&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt; This role also has an opportunity to take on and grow a management and leadership role in the EMEA region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is an experienced commercial attorney who has partnered closely with in-house business teams, and &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;sales and channel&lt;/span&gt; teams, in particular, and is passionate about supporting the business and who thrives in solving legal, technology and business issues. &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate also has management and leadership experience in the EMEA region, and has a good understanding of the EMEA regulatory scheme and how it impacts contractual relationships and negotiations, including GDPR, DORA, TUPE, and the EU AI Act. &lt;/span&gt;The ideal candidate must be empathetic and a team player who is effective in collaborating with others &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty h-lparen&quot;&gt;(and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt; hopefully enjoy a few laughs and &lt;/span&gt;a bit of fun along the way&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;!).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely and create strong working relationships with Dropbox’s business teams, with a primary focus on &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;sales and channel partner&lt;/span&gt;, finance, product, and other business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage personally in complex deals and work collaboratively with various company teams to implement company initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and collaboratively implement an innovative strategy to increase the efficiency and effectiveness of delivering commercial legal support to Dropbox’s business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our LegalOps team to increase process automation, legal technology, and other efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;Be an effective manager, leader, and mentor to other EMEA based commercial legal team members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an active and trusted leader, problem solver, and innovator to key stakeholders across the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;Minimum of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;+ years as a practicing commercial attorney, including substantive experience in drafting and negotiating complex commercial agreements, including SaaS, licensing, technology, equipment, and marketing agreements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;Working understanding of the EMEA regulatory scheme and how it impacts contractual relationships and negotiations, including GDPR, DORA, TUPE, and the EU AI Act&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight thread-722649370359092058080655 attrcomment attrcommentfirst thread-722649370359092058080655-first&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;Experience partnering with globally distributed in-house business teams, particularly &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight thread-722649370359092058080655 attrcomment author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;sales and channel &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight thread-722649370359092058080655 attrcomment&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;teams, at a SaaS company to handle a high volume of complex commercial transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process and tool focused innovator who drives performance and efficiencies while building trusted relationships and empowering business partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex legal issues into clear and simple guidance, and to partner effectively across all levels of the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for client service and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;Familiarity with procurement legal systems and tools and experience developing and / or enhancing legal procurement processes and procedures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;At least one year of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z2nsz89zz74zz79zhr6tvtz80zz79zz79zz67zaz73zz67z78z69zz69zz74z0z81zz74z&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;people &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;management and leadership experience in an in-house legal environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High integrity, strong ethics, and an unflappable demeanor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;J.D. with strong academic credentials and demonstrated record of success as a lawyer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Member in good standing of bar and &lt;span class=&quot; h-lparen&quot;&gt;(if&lt;/span&gt; applicable) in-house counsel registration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong record of close partnership and being embedded with &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;sales and channel partners&lt;/span&gt; teams in day-to-day &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;sales and channel&lt;/span&gt; deal work and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience implementing new &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;sales and channel&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;partner&lt;/span&gt; processes to drive efficiencies and empower self service with procurement teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to handle multiple types of cross-functional commercial matters, including &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zez77zz88zz90zz87zz72zz79z7plz90zja0ya54vz86zz74zz75z0aty&quot;&gt;procurement&lt;/span&gt; facing agreements, M&amp;amp;A integration and support, and commercial disputes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United Kingdom Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£125,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£170,200 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€119.900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€162.200 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an Operations Lead to act as a bridge between the Office of the CEO&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(OCEO)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt; and Dropbox’s business units, helping operationalize our company-wide business rhythms with rigor, clarity, and consistency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Dropbox is an operationally heavy company; we believe that sweating the details of how work gets done drives better results. This role sits at the center of that philosophy. While there are known operating rhythms and mechanisms to support&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt; planning, roadmapping, launch, QBRs, Board processes), the exact scope of this role will evolve based on where leverage is most needed. We’re looking for someone who can step into ambiguity, identify friction or gaps, and independently shape high-impact solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;This is an individual-contributor role requiring comfort working with executive leaders, Chiefs of Staff, embedded operational teams, and EPD partners. The ideal candidate is scrappy, detail-oriented, and systems-minded — someone who can quickly build context, earn trust, and drive clarity in complex environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
