&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Dropbox is an operationally heavy company; we believe that sweating the details of how work gets done drives better results. This role sits at the center of that philosophy. While there are known operating rhythms and mechanisms to support&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt; planning, roadmapping, launch, QBRs, Board processes), the exact scope of this role will evolve based on where leverage is most needed. We’re looking for someone who can step into ambiguity, identify friction or gaps, and independently shape high-impact solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;This is an individual-contributor role requiring comfort working with executive leaders, Chiefs of Staff, embedded operational teams, and EPD partners. The ideal candidate is scrappy, detail-oriented, and systems-minded — someone who can quickly build context, earn trust, and drive clarity in complex environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
