&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Proactively flag and collaborate with CX or Product teams to resolve customer issues efficiently&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Prepare and deliver Success Business Reviews, providing insights on adoption, planning, and product updates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Maintain a deep understanding of Dropbox products and roadmap, promote new features, and serve as the voice of the customer internally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal teams such as marketing, product, and sales to ensure customer satisfaction, retention, and growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
