&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z78zbmz68zz77zz84zz65z5cz77zz70zw7mz89zxz76zx2z67z9cz87zz85z9ksuz69z&quot;&gt;Experience with both scaled SaaS products, and pre-PMF or 0→1 efforts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95g4yz80ztqz73zernaz81zz66zz67zvfu2z83z4z83z04uc50mz88z&quot;&gt;Success leading the thoughtful integration of generative design tools, LLMs, and computational design methodologies into creative workflows while preserving team autonomy and elevating overall design quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
