&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz85zijkz72zjkz88zz83zz79z0oz82zz90zz69zz88zpz70zz82zz122zurz75zz75zvhz75zfz90zj&quot;&gt;Interest or experience in developer &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz85zijkz72zjkz88zz83zz79z0oz82zz90zz69zz88zpz70zz82zz122zurz75zz75zvhz75zfz90zj&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#B5DCAF&quot;&gt;tooling, build systems, or productivity engineering&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz85zijkz72zjkz88zz83zz79z0oz82zz90zz69zz88zpz70zz82zz122zurz75zz75zvhz75zfz90zj h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz85zijkz72zjkz88zz83zz79z0oz82zz90zz69zz88zpz70zz82zz122zurz75zz75zvhz75zfz90zj&quot;&gt; Bazel, RSPack, esbuild, or similar).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz85zijkz72zjkz88zz83zz79z0oz82zz90zz69zz88zpz70zz82zz122zurz75zz75zvhz75zfz90zj&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, with the ability to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz85zijkz72zjkz88zz83zz79z0oz82zz90zz69zz88zpz70zz82zz122zurz75zz75zvhz75zfz90zj&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#B5DCAF&quot;&gt;debug and improve developer workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz85zijkz72zjkz88zz83zz79z0oz82zz90zz69zz88zpz70zz82zz122zurz75zz75zvhz75zfz90zj&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
