&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86zhnz122zz81z6z80z0y1z83zz85zpz81zz87ztc3mlz69zz74zz87zq2z69ztrz65z0&quot;&gt;Capable of taking ownership of long-term projects and seeing them through to completion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz66zwgz76zz77zz88zoz67zz83z1z87zpoz80zz84zsz83zx8z67zz66zz84zz76zz74z7z83zz72zz86z&quot;&gt;Ability to set&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z8h00wiph763z70zkxz79zz89ztyz87zz66zjm6pez70zz84zz68zexo&quot;&gt; medium-to-long term strategy for business-impacting projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
