&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxwoz79zz80zz69zuicbz75zya10z73zdru2z73zz68z9jz76z2z71zphz80zq1&quot;&gt;8+ years of software engineering experience, with at least 5+ years dedicated to building and deploying production-scale AI/ML systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
