&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4qnhz74zcz71zaz80z9z73zz83z6z70zj0z71zz87zcgz122zz79zz86zz65zpz71zz83zdgh&quot;&gt;As a Senior Manager, Product Management for Web Experience within the Integrated Marketing organization, you will help shape and advance the Dropbox.com experience in partnership with design, engineering, and marketing teams. You will translate the north-star strategy into actionable roadmaps, manage the day-to-day execution of web initiatives, and ensure the website continues to serve as a compelling expression of our brand and a critical part of the user lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4qnhz74zcz71zaz80z9z73zz83z6z70zj0z71zz87zcgz122zz79zz86zz65zpz71zz83zdgh&quot;&gt;In this role, you will manage and coach a small team of product managers and producers, guiding them through short and mid-term roadmap development, prioritization, and sprint planning. You will also work closely with stakeholders across marketing and product to ensure the web experience aligns with key business objectives, user needs, and campaign priorities. This role offers the opportunity to directly shape Dropbox’s digital presence while gaining meaningful cross-functional exposure and driving impact at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4qnhz74zcz71zaz80z9z73zz83z6z70zj0z71zz87zcgz122zz79zz86zz65zpz71zz83zdgh&quot;&gt;Manage and mentor a team of web product managers and producers, supporting their development and ensuring high-quality execution across initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4qnhz74zcz71zaz80z9z73zz83z6z70zj0z71zz87zcgz122zz79zz86zz65zpz71zz83zdgh&quot;&gt;Translate the north-star strategy into mid-term roadmaps and partner with the team to define and deliver near-term priorities, features, and improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4qnhz74zcz71zaz80z9z73zz83z6z70zj0z71zz87zcgz122zz79zz86zz65zpz71zz83zdgh&quot;&gt;Lead cross-functional collaboration with web engineering, web design, and integrated marketing partners to drive high-impact enhancements to the Dropbox.com experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4qnhz74zcz71zaz80z9z73zz83z6z70zj0z71zz87zcgz122zz79zz86zz65zpz71zz83zdgh&quot;&gt;Partner with stakeholders across marketing, product, and design to align on goals, requirements, and success criteria for web initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4qnhz74zcz71zaz80z9z73zz83z6z70zj0z71zz87zcgz122zz79zz86zz65zpz71zz83zdgh&quot;&gt;Support the execution of optimization efforts, including user journey improvements, experimentation, and data-driven enhancements to engagement and conversion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4qnhz74zcz71zaz80z9z73zz83z6z70zj0z71zz87zcgz122zz79zz86zz65zpz71zz83zdgh&quot;&gt;Ensure roadmap visibility, prioritization clarity, and consistent communication with cross-functional teams and leaders regarding progress and outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4qnhz74zcz71zaz80z9z73zz83z6z70zj0z71zz87zcgz122zz79zz86zz65zpz71zz83zdgh&quot;&gt;Maintain a customer-first mindset, leveraging insights and qualitative and quantitative data to inform product decisions and identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
