&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zwz67zw6j0lz83zraz81znz79zz80z2z71zc1thpz83ztz86zwg&quot;&gt;Improve mobile monetization by optimizing mobile upgrade journeys, experimenting with placements and messaging, and partnering on app-store/platform constraints and opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4nz90zz89zwz67zw6j0lz83zraz81znz79zz80z2z71zc1thpz83ztz86zwg&quot;&gt;Monitor funnel health and cohort performance, balancing conversion gains with long-term retention, trust, and user experience quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
