&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;Drive pipeline generation through outbound activity, account expansion, and partner engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;Ensure the team is not reliant on renewals by building a strong culture of proactive pipeline creation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
