&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;Product, Marketing, Customer Success, Solutions teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt; and leverage partners to accelerate pipeline and influence GTM strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
