&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify&lt;/strong&gt; and mitigate risks by serving as an &quot;early warning system,&quot; mapping complex dependencies across &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Technology&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Global Operations&lt;/strong&gt; to protect the critical path.&lt;/li&gt;
