&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Variable (8–10-hour shifts)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must be flexible to work holidays, weekends, and occasional overtime.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be remote, but is not eligible to be hired in CA, CT, NJ, NY, PA, WA.&lt;/p&gt;
