&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production assistance:&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare files for production, including resizing assets for various channels, styling presentations, and organizing creative libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in creative brainstorms and team meetings, bringing fresh perspectives and a &quot;builder&quot; mindset to the table.&lt;/li&gt;
