&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is needed to drive revenue growth through data-led and AI-driven onboarding and activation campaigns. You’ll work with Marketing, Ops, and Analytics teams to execute and optimize programs across email, in-app, and other channels. This role uses customer insights to inform lifecycle transitions, run experiments, and create a seamless experience that fuels customer activation and revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and optimize onboarding and activation marketing programs that drive account expansion and reinforce the Twilio brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute AI-driven, data-informed campaigns that customize engagement across the customer lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and execute omnichannel campaigns, including email, website, Twilio Console, SMS, and in-app channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with campaign managers to ensure proper alignment and cross-promotion within automated nurtures and broader growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
