&lt;li&gt;Design and run experiments to test and refine onboarding and activation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Analytics to build data-driven programs using Twilio Segment and other tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously evaluate performance and use insights to optimize strategy and maximize expansion outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
