&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in growth marketing, with a focus on onboarding, cross-sell, upsell, and program management in a SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI for execution across the campaign production process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Marketing Automation tools is essential; familiarity with Twilio Segment or reverse ETL platforms is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to design and execute omnichannel campaigns triggered by customer behavior and data signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the customer lifecycle and how to surface relevant expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preference for individuals who are skilled in writing persuasive sales copy and leveraging behavioral and psychological principles to drive engagement and conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data-driven mindset, with a genuine interest in analyzing performance data, building pivot tables, and uncovering actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to &lt;strong&gt;independently&lt;/strong&gt; analyze data, surface insights, and identify actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in managing complex, multi-team projects with precision and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator and collaborator across cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in Growth marketing and lifecycle functions in a SaaS setup (preferably with B2C orientation) will be given preference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce, SQL, Looker/Tableau experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background with ability to self-serve analytics, understand KPIs and experiment reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Past experience with Sendgrid or a similar subscription-based platform is a good qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
