&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in System Integrator (SI) or Technology Partner ecosystems focused on building technical practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency in API-first architectures and the ability to build functional prototypes to demonstrate integration concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication skills with the ability to convey complex technical topics to both executive and developer audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in multiple languages applicable to the LATAM region: Portuguese, Spanish (desired) and English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subject Matter Expertise in AI-powered customer engagement (Agentic workflows, RAG, LLMs), CCaaS, or Telecom (SIP, WebRTC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a strategic influencer, providing insights to internal product teams to shape global roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be remote, and based in Brazil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
