&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Sales, Sales Operations, Sales Support, or Revenue Operations within a high-growth SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of direct people management experience with a focus on coaching and professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven technical proficiency in Salesforce, CPQ (Configure, Price, Quote) workflows, and deal desk mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to track team capacity, SLAs, and utilization rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
