&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a seasoned and strategic Senior Partner Alliance Manager to lead and grow our partner ecosystem across LATAM focusing on the Spanish-speaking countries of Mexico and Columbia. &amp;nbsp;This high-impact role requires a leader with a strong track record in partner sales, deep regional knowledge, and the ability to build executive-level relationships that drive partner-influenced revenue.&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Partner Alliance Manager, you will play a critical role in shaping the success of our regional partner strategy, working cross-functionally with Sales, Marketing, Solutions Engineering, and Product teams to activate and accelerate our most strategic partners. You’ll be expected to operate with autonomy, bring strong executive presence, and leverage an existing network of trusted partner relationships to scale our influence in LATAM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
