&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of tax experience in a Big 4 firm or a multinational corporate tax department. • Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, or Law. Professional tax qualification (AITI/CTA) or Accounting qualification (ACA/ACCA) is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech-forward mindset: experience using AI tools (e.g. ChatGPT/Claude) for research or data tools (Power Query/Alteryx) for data clean-up is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Microsoft Excel, with an interest in moving from manual spreadsheets toward automated pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Working knowledge of Oracle Fusion, or similar ERP/EPM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
