&lt;li&gt;Help manage our social channels — including LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, and X.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own social analytics, reporting, and competitive insights that shape future strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage our developer social content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to help manage our employee brand social content.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
