&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of troubleshooting and resolving operational issues, with opportunities to enhance existing troubleshooting processes and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the refinement of the team&#39;s ticket backlog, estimating work and follow Agile ceremonies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor early in career engineers and contribute to a culture of continuous learning and improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
