&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in statistical analysis, experimentation and/or scenario planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of SEO and emerging AI Search (AEO/GEO) landscapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hypothesis-driven thinker who does not just report the &quot;what,&quot; but actively tests the &quot;why&quot;. Able to formulate testable guesses and distill the essential from complex marketing data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with running or interpreting advanced measurement frameworks (Incrementality, MMM, MTA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly reliable and a self-starter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest or experience in applying AI-driven solutions to analytics workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with a passion for clean, trustworthy data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaborator across cross functional teams; skilled in managing stakeholder projects end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
