&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting various stakeholder functions and their insights: Brand, PR, Social, Content, Demand Generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with BI tools (Tableau, Looker Studio) and modeling (ROI, LTV:CAC, payback).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest or exposure to fraud monitoring tools and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Customer Data Platforms (CDPs) and analytics data integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
