&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of Product Management experience, with at least 3 years focused on commerce, billing, or financial platforms at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead complex cross-functional initiatives across engineering, finance, risk, and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical acumen with experience in APIs, extensible platforms, and complex system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven decision maker with a track record of defining KPIs and measuring platform success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and executive-level stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS, large-scale platforms, or multi-product ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with Agile and related agile tooling, such as, Jira&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform Leadership: Previous leadership of platform migrations or unification efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ERP &amp;amp; Financial Integration: Experience integrating core billing engines with downstream financial systems like NetSuite, SAP, or Workday for automated revenue recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Tax Compliance: Familiarity with global tax engines (e.g., Avalara, Vertex) and the regulatory requirements of &quot;Invoiced Billing&quot; in international markets (VAT, GST, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/ML Product Literacy: Experience identifying and implementing AI-driven solutions for financial or data-heavy domains, such as predictive revenue forecasting, automated discrepancy resolution, or LLM-integrated developer documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS/CPQ Knowledge: Familiarity with the &quot;Quote-to-Cash&quot; ecosystem, including CPQ (Configure, Price, Quote) tools and how they interface with a core catalog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
