&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to understand business needs and translate requirements into technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce Certified Administrator (ADM-201)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Salesforce CPQ administration and configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation, communication, and facilitation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive experience on debugging and troubleshooting in Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
