&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Twilio, we’re shaping the future of communications, all from the comfort of our homes. We deliver innovative solutions to&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;hundreds of thousands of businesses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and empower millions of developers worldwide to craft personalized customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our dedication to &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote-first work&lt;/a&gt;, and strong culture of connection and global inclusion means that no matter your location, you’re part of a vibrant team with diverse experiences making a global impact each day. As we continue to revolutionize how the world interacts, we’re acquiring new skills and experiences that make work feel truly rewarding. Your career at Twilio is in your hands.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We use Artificial Intelligence (AI) to help make our hiring process efficient. That said, every hiring decision is made by real Twilions!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;See yourself at Twilio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team as Twilio’s next Transfer Pricing Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio is looking for an Transfer Pricing&amp;nbsp; Manager&amp;nbsp; located in Ireland to join our global tax team.&amp;nbsp; As the Global Transfer Pricing Manager at Twilio, you will be an architect and guardian of our intercompany transaction framework. In a high-growth, cloud-communications environment, our value chain is complex—spanning R&amp;amp;D, digital infrastructure, and global sales. You will ensure that our global operations are compliant, tax-efficient, and aligned with the latest OECD guidelines and local regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You aren&#39;t just a &quot;compliance checker&quot;; you are a strategic partner who understands how code, data, and communication APIs translate into taxable value across borders.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our ideal candidate is a highly motivated and collaborative individual with transfer pricing experience and an eagerness to learn in an AI native environment . We aren’t just &quot;filing forms&quot;; we are building a scalable, &lt;strong&gt;AI-native tax infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; that supports a company moving at the speed of the cloud. You will have the autonomy to design processes from scratch—moving away from manual data entry toward high-value strategic analysis enabled by the latest AI tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the charge in integrating AI and automation into our transfer pricing workflow. This includes automating benchmark searches, using AI for draft local file narratives, and building &quot;self-service&quot; intercompany models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the end-to-end global transfer pricing lifecycle, including the preparation and review of Master Files, Local Files, and Country-by-Country Reporting (CbCR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the operational transfer pricing process—setting, monitoring, and adjusting intercompany prices throughout the year to ensure legal entities hit target profitability as well as ensure that the quarterly close calculations are robust and accurate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document complex intercompany transactions and develop robust policies for the valuation of intangible assets (IP), know-how, and customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage global transfer pricing audits and controversy matters, acting as the primary point of contact for external advisors and tax authorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Economics, Finance, or Law. CPA, CTA, or JD/LLM in Tax is highly preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of dedicated transfer pricing experience in Big 4 public accounting or a high-growth US multinational corporation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Oracle Fusion or similar ERP/ EPM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be proficient with Microsoft Excel/Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tax technology software &amp;amp; AI tools&amp;nbsp; is beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;This role will be remote, and based in Ireland&lt;/p&gt;
