&lt;p&gt;If you’re a strategic marketer who loves building value narratives, crafting go-to-market strategies, and driving complex cross-functional programs from concept to execution, this is an opportunity to make a major impact on one of Discord’s most beloved products.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
