&lt;li&gt;You’re both a strategic storyteller and operator, able to connect high-level brand value to detailed GTM execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience partnering with Sales or Business Development teams, supporting pitch development, building enablement materials, and influencing partner decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
