&lt;li&gt;Maintain office documentation and procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor office budget and track expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee vendor relationships and contracts, ensuring competitive pricing and quality service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain inventory systems for office supplies, snacks, and equipment&lt;/li&gt;
