&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in brand design with agencies or in-house teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio demonstrating concept-driven, high-quality design work across a range of mediums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills; comfortable presenting work and rationale to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of craft across typography, layout, motion, and visual hierarchy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail, you sweat the small stuff to make every piece feel intentional and refined.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic mindset with an understanding of how design impacts business and brand perception.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Figma.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
