&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain brand standards that balance consistency with creative flexibility across teams and channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate company strategy and brand vision into clear, compelling visual direction in partnership with leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver new brand expressions that advance the identity while preserving recognition and equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact brand work beyond the core system, including special campaigns, sub-brands, and select product or service launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Art direct and contribute to brand campaigns, collaborating with external partners and internal teams to ensure exceptional craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance and feedback across the organization to raise the quality and effectiveness of brand execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
