&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in typography, color, composition, and building scalable visual systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to articulate design decisions and build alignment with cross-functional partners and senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple workstreams in fast-paced, evolving environments&lt;/li&gt;
