&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of exceeding sales goals/quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a sales management environment and or 3-4 years experience in a sales or business development role, preferably in the advertising industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of developing early career professionals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative problem-solver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
