&lt;li&gt;Proven experience driving the sale and activation of data and measurement solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to consistently achieve results against revenue and sales performance goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship builder with executive-level presence and the ability to influence senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess a deep understanding of ad tech, programmatic buying and Agency Holding company ecosystems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable introducing, positioning, and selling innovative or emerging customer engagement solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded and financially literate, with a data-driven approach to decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the CPG industry and its advertising and measurement needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to remain composed and effective in fast-paced, evolving environments; thrives amid ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as needed to support partners and business objectives&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
