&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of product management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building and shipping consumer-facing commerce products end-to-end, with 2+ years building LLM-powered products in production&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record launching at least one 0-to-1 product to general availability with measurable impact on adoption, conversion, revenue, or GTV&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency with AI/ML systems and data flows; ability to partner with engineering and machine learning on dependencies and scope tradeoffs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining product OKRs, with significant experience using experimentation to improve products and achieve desired outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and presentation skills with senior leadership and external enterprise partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a technical, quantitative, or related field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
