&lt;li&gt;Background spanning startup and large company environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain expertise in ecommerce, retail, grocery, or marketplace dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or improving LLM agent systems and products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with experimentation at scale (A/B testing) and with trust, safety, privacy, and compliance considerations for GenAI products.&lt;/li&gt;
