 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re transforming the grocery industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;im&quot;&gt;At Instacart, we invite the world to share love through food because we believe everyone should have access to the food they love and more time to enjoy it together. Where others see a simple need for grocery delivery, we see exciting complexity and endless opportunity to serve the varied needs of our community. We work to deliver an essential service that customers rely on to get their groceries and household goods, while also offering safe and flexible earnings opportunities to Instacart Personal Shoppers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instacart has become a lifeline for millions of people, and we’re building the team to help push our shopping cart forward. If you’re ready to do the best work of your life, come join our table.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instacart is a Flex First team &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There’s no one-size fits all approach to how we do our best work. Our employees have the flexibility to choose where they do their best work—whether it’s from home, an office, or your favorite coffee shop—while staying connected and building community through regular in-person events. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instacart.careers/flex-first&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://instacart.careers/remote/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1651869232122000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw37OlxP8hAKN7nq4YwHQH7e&quot;&gt;Learn more about our flexible approach to where we work.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instacart is expanding rapidly, and we’re seeking a Sales Planner to join our Off‑Platform Sales team. This hire will assist in delivering customer‑centric solutions rooted in Instacart 1P data, partnering with Off‑Platform and Brand Partnership sales teams to win RFPs through architecting bespoke solutions, own delivery from launch through wrap, and identify &amp;amp; pitch incremental investment opportunities along the way. This role blends strategic planning with operational excellence to drive strong outcomes for our off‑platform advertisers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sales Strategy and Planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify, pitch, and secure incremental revenue opportunities on assigned portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate RFP’s into tailored media solutions rooted in Instacart’s Off-Platform solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in audience planning throughout deal cycle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build proposals and media plans, close deals, and execute IOs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in crafting compelling narratives that differentiate Instacart &amp;amp; ultimately lead to off-platform activations via our 1P data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity &amp;amp; assist in pitching net-new whitespace revenue opportunities to help our advertising achieve their intended outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Campaign Execution and Performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive incremental revenue through media buyer influence within current, upsell, and expansion opportunities.Use data and strategic partner skills to identify client investment whitespace gaps and plans that increase our Off-Platform adoption and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in launch-to-wrap execution: aligning on success metrics ahead of launch, ensuring pacing, optimizations as well as post-campaign reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross‑functionally (Ad Ops, Analytics, Product, Creative, Legal, Finance) to unblock hurdles and activate with excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat every live campaign as a sales opportunity — consistently look for upsell and renewal conversations, not just delivery management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in media or sales planning at an agency, publisher, or platform; strong grasp of programmatic, social, and video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest in sales - comfortable with outreach, pitching, and closing. Motivated by hitting &amp;amp; exceeding revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management, organization, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative problem solver who thrives amid ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to tell a compelling story through data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter with hunger to achieve goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Instacart provides highly market-competitive compensation and benefits in each location where our employees work. This role is remote and the base pay range for a successful candidate is dependent on their permanent work location. Please review our Flex First remote work policy &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://instacart.careers/flex-first/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Offers may vary based on many factors, such as candidate experience and skills required for the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Additionally, this role is eligible for a new hire equity grant as well as annual refresh grants. Please rea&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;d more about our benefits offerings &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://instacart.careers/taste-of-instacart/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For US based candidates, the base pay ranges for a successful candidate are listed below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;CA, NY, CT, NJ&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$97,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$102,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;WA&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$93,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$99,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;OR, DE, ME, MA, MD, NH, RI, VT, DC, PA, VA, CO, TX, IL, HI&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$89,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$94,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;All other states&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$81,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$85,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re transforming the grocery industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;im&quot;&gt;At Instacart, we invite the world to share love through food because we believe everyone should have access to the food they love and more time to enjoy it together. Where others see a simple need for grocery delivery, we see exciting complexity and endless opportunity to serve the varied needs of our community. We work to deliver an essential service that customers rely on to get their groceries and household goods, while also offering safe and flexible earnings opportunities to Instacart Personal Shoppers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instacart has become a lifeline for millions of people, and we’re building the team to help push our shopping cart forward. If you’re ready to do the best work of your life, come join our table.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instacart is a Flex First team &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There’s no one-size fits all approach to how we do our best work. Our employees have the flexibility to choose where they do their best work—whether it’s from home, an office, or your favorite coffee shop—while staying connected and building community through regular in-person events. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instacart.careers/flex-first&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://instacart.careers/remote/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1651869232122000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw37OlxP8hAKN7nq4YwHQH7e&quot;&gt;Learn more about our flexible approach to where we work.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Instacart’s Revenue Accounting team and help shape how we recognize and report revenue across our rapidly evolving retailer ecosystem. You will focus on retailer-related revenue streams while supporting international expansion and future acquisitions, partnering closely with teams across Accounting &amp;amp; Finance, Data, Legal, Sales, and Operations to deliver accurate, timely, and insightful results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a foundational member of a new international revenue accounting pod composed of a Manager and a Senior Accountant. You will roll up your sleeves to operationalize new markets, standardize policies, and drive automation using tools like Alteryx and AI-enabled workflows—all in a fast-paced, highly collaborative environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you thrive in ambiguity, enjoy building scalable processes, and want your work to directly influence how the business grows globally, this is an exciting opportunity to make an outsized impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end revenue accounting for retailer-related revenue streams across multiple entities, including month-end close, journal entries, reconciliations, and revenue analytics under ASC 606.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support international expansion and acquisitions by operationalizing revenue policies, mapping data and opening balances, and integrating new entities and products into our revenue processes and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive process improvement and automation using tools such as Alteryx and SQL-enabled workflows to reduce manual work, improve accuracy, and shorten close timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Finance (FP&amp;amp;A, Billing, Collections), Data/Engineering, Legal, and Sales to ensure contract terms, data pipelines, and system configurations align with revenue recognition requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong internal controls over financial reporting, prepare audit-ready documentation, and manage external audit and SOX requests related to retailer revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clear, decision-ready reporting and insights on revenue drivers, trends, and variances, and proactively identify risks and opportunities as the business evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in revenue accounting under US GAAP, including hands-on ownership of month-end close activities and account reconciliations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of ASC 606 (revenue recognition), including contract review, variable consideration, and deferred revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Excel (e.g., pivot tables, lookups) and comfort working with large datasets and revenue subledgers; experience preparing audit-ready workpapers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a fast-paced environment with cross-functional partners and maintaining SOX-compliant processes and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to support West Coast business hours in a remote-first environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPA (active) or progress toward CPA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with international operations, multi-entity/multi-currency environments, and familiarity with IFRS 15.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with ERP and revenue systems (e.g., NetSuite, Workday Financials, Zuora, RevPro/RevRec), and data/automation tools (e.g., Alteryx, SQL, Python).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background supporting M&amp;amp;A integrations (policy alignment, system/process onboarding, opening balance and data mapping).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving measurable process improvements that reduce manual work and accelerate close timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
