&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with auction theory, mechanism design, or algorithmic pricing (e.g., generalized second-price auctions, VCG, bid shading, reserve pricing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or analyzing CPC/CPM bidding systems, budget pacing, or bid landscape models at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of business trade-offs when working on a multi-sided marketplace, particularly the interplay between advertiser ROI, consumer experience, and platform revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence in collaborating with and influencing cross-functional stakeholders (e.g., Product, Engineering, Sales) at a senior level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MS/PhD in Statistics, Economics, Operations Research, Applied Mathematics, Computer Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
