&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of product management experience building and shipping SaaS or platform products end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years working in retail technology, e-commerce fulfillment, order management, POS, or in-store operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record owning a multi-quarter roadmap and launching products that drive measurable business impact (e.g., adoption, revenue, NPS, or operational efficiency).&lt;/li&gt;
