&lt;li&gt;Background integrating with enterprise retail systems (e.g., ERP, inventory, kitchen display systems, loyalty, payments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success running pilots with enterprise customers and scaling features across 100+ locations.&lt;/li&gt;
